 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()` creates an in-memory rental desk. Add equipment with an ID, a kind (`'board'` or
+`'sail'`), and a daily price in integer euro cents. `quote({ itemId, start, end })` returns the cost for
+the requested whole-day period. `book(...)` reserves the item and returns a booking ID with the quote.
+Times must be UTC ISO-8601 timestamps at midnight; `end` is the midnight starting the day after the
+last rental day. Bookings for the same item cannot overlap. Quotes and bookings reject unknown items and
+invalid periods; bookings also reject periods already reserved. Booking IDs are sequential within each
+service instance. All state is kept in memory and is lost when the service instance is discarded.
